<title>CANADA: Caledonia to Scandinavian properties.</title>
<headline>Caledonia to Scandinavian properties.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caledonia Mining Corp said on Monday it agreed to sell its Scandinavian exploration properties to Poplar Resources Ltd.</p>
<p>Caledonia said it would sell its Finnish and Swedish exploration properties, licenses and license applications for 3.3 million Poplar common shares valued at C$0.30 a share.</p>
<p>Poplar would issue 2.15 million shares immediately and a further 1.183 million shares next October, Caledonia said.</p>
<p>The sale was part of Caledonia's program to focus on its most promising exploration properties, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
